<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-040" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-040-zixia" source-id="s-nanqishu-040-zixia-ws2272748">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-040-zixia:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">南郡王<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zixia:p001:m0003" ref="kix_r92_2ed_P">子夏</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zixia:p001:m0006" ref="kix_r92_2ed_P">雲廣</persName>，世祖第二十三子也。上春秋高，<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zixia:p001:m0023" ref="kix_r92_2ed_P">子夏</persName>最幼，寵愛過諸子。初，世祖夢金翅鳥下殿庭，搏食小龍無數，乃飛上天。永泰元年，<persName id="c-nanqishu-040-zixia:p001:m0063" ref="kix_r92_2ed_P">子夏</persName>誅。年七歲。</p>
</text>
